{"symbol":"TEL1L.VS","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:27:50Z","info":{"address1":"Saltoniskiu str. 7A","city":"Vilnius","zip":"08126","country":"Lithuania","phone":"370 5 262 1511","fax":"370 5 212 6665","website":"https://www.telia.lt","industry":"Telecom Services","industryKey":"telecom-services","industryDisp":"Telecom Services","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"Telia Lietuva, AB provides telecommunications, information technology (IT), and television (TV) services to business and residential customers in the Republic of Lithuania, Sweden, Norway, Finland, Estonia, and internationally. The company operates through Business Customer, Private Customer, and Other segments. The Business Customer segment offers telecommunication, IT, equipment sale and customer care services to large, medium, and small businesses, public institutions and enterprises, and locals and international telecommunication operators. The Private Customer segment provides telecommunication and TV services to private individuals. The Other segment engages in the technology and support activities. It also offers mobile connection plans; internet and telephony services; cloud and data centers, computer workstations, server and system maintenance services, and IT security solutions; IoT solutions; travel and equipment insurance products; Telia1 loyalty program; Telia Play television and Smart Connect products; and wholesale services. In addition, the company provides phones and accessories, computer equipment, audio equipment, tablets and e-readers, smartwatches and bracelets, smart things and home products, network equipment, televisions, gaming equipment, and health devices through e-shops. Telia Lietuva, AB was formerly known as Teo LT, AB and changed its name to Telia Lietuva, AB in February 2017. The company was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Vilnius, Lithuania. Telia Lietuva, AB is a subsidiary of Telia Company AB (publ).","fullTimeEmployees":1544,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Giedre  Kaminskaite-Salters","age":47,"title":"Chief Executive Officer","yearBorn":1978,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":714722,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Daina  Veckyte","title":"Head of Finance","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Antanas  Poska","age":58,"title":"Director of The Accounting Department","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Vygintas  Domarkas","title":"Head of Digital & Technology","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Darius  Dziaugys","age":54,"title":"Head of Investor Relations","yearBorn":1971,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Daiva  Kasperaviciene","age":57,"title":"Head of Legal and People & Culture","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Vaida  Jurkoniene","age":54,"title":"Head of Marketing & Communication","yearBorn":1971,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Elina  Dapkeviciene","title":"Head of Sales & Customer Service","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Vytautas  Bucinskas","age":51,"title":"Head of Business Assurance, Resilience & Sustainability","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Lina  Bandzine","title":"Head of Consumer unit","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":4,"previousClose":2.23,"open":2.23,"dayLow":2.22,"dayHigh":2.23,"regularMarketPreviousClose":2.23,"regularMarketOpen":2.23,"regularMarketDayLow":2.22,"regularMarketDayHigh":2.23,"dividendRate":0.14,"dividendYie